{"id":"d11a90cd01cfc9efe33ed90f22a8d7420ba42262","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232388","title":"做了个 AI 办公桌面应用，想抢 workbuddy 的市场，大伙觉得如何，哈哈","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"doujiangjiyaozha","excerpt":"分享创造 - @doujiangjiyaozha - github 地址:https://github.com/Yoan98/Ncurator官网地址:https://www.ncurator.com介绍：与 workbu","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/办公\"><li></li> 办公</a><a href=\"/tag/本地\"><li></li> 本地</a></P><p><span>21 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-06 16:04:21 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943489\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c4c7/ff66/293320_normal.png?m=1782224054\" alt=\"zhuanggu\" data-uid=\"293320\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhuanggu\">zhuanggu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 10:42:55 +08:00\">21h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>同为做小工具的人，支持一下。AI 办公这个方向确实竞争激烈，但我觉得细分场景还有机会——比如我做的 SaveAnswer 就是专注「 AI 回答保存」这一个点。个人看法：与其跟 WorkBuddy 正面刚，不如先在一个小场景做到最好，积累用户再说。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943664\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5e37/b76a/119748_normal.png?m=1710228712\" alt=\"yh7gdiaYW\" data-uid=\"119748\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yh7gdiaYW\">yh7gdiaYW</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:06:23 +08:00\">20h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>赛道太卷，你这个产品设计已经过时了。现在是 cowork 类客户端直接内置 office 三件套编辑器（ workbuddy 给这个取名叫人机双写）做 AI 交互，不只是看看 diff 和产出物</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943693\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7cb6/89a9/577242_normal.png?m=1685705071\" alt=\"dudubaba\" data-uid=\"577242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dudubaba\">dudubaba</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:11:55 +08:00\">20h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>workbuddy 最大粘性是现在还是免费使用 AI 模型，一旦收费用户量至少流失一半，所以谁有钱烧，谁就能有市场</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943706\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/af9fa40673a7f44a65b8796c65afc7fb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Deveik\" data-uid=\"409639\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Deveik\">Deveik</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:14:08 +08:00\">20h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>确实卷，几乎所有大厂都在往 work 的方向上卷。<br>感觉佬瞄的用户会比较少一些，即普通用户看不到楼楼做的优化的优势，然后专业用户会选择更直接的 cli 或自己倒腾工具。<br>比如拿免费使用来说，其实 workbuddy 也免费，时不时还有活动，拿点积分，还能白嫖下各类国产最新模型，对于普通用户来说挺够用了，也不太需要配置 ai key 啥的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943718\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/598f/e08b/540117_normal.png?m=1775783079\" alt=\"Sundayz\" data-uid=\"540117\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sundayz\">Sundayz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:15:17 +08:00\">20h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很多人没意识到，单纯做 AI 工具链一定是死路一条，只有具备 AI 大模型创造能力的才有活路。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943739\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5e37/b76a/119748_normal.png?m=1710228712\" alt=\"yh7gdiaYW\" data-uid=\"119748\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yh7gdiaYW\">yh7gdiaYW</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:18:03 +08:00\">20h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/doujiangjiyaozha\">doujiangjiyaozha</a> workbuddy+腾讯文档是他们家的卖点，但类似的东西已经有很多家在做了，光我们部门就有两个内部产品赛马。只是要产出+diff ，没有再做一个客户端的意义，也无法和这种内置编辑器的产品竞争</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943805\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3fbbdf1850ecdc7c30efc804496d79c8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"KingHL\" data-uid=\"61855\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/KingHL\">KingHL</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:26:37 +08:00\">20h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你这是准备在最火的赛道上硬刚 workbuddy\\TraeWork 吗，个人开发者最优方向应该是找个细分市场吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944031\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7bad/8a20/441003_normal.png?m=1716075803\" alt=\"ebushicao\" data-uid=\"441003\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ebushicao\">ebushicao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:51:58 +08:00\">20h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你这个重点完全没有竞争力呀... workbuddy 配置自己的 api key 不也一样，何况 workbuddy 还有免费额度，轻量使用压根不需要任何付费。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944049\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9076/1485/374560_normal.png?m=1679370871\" alt=\"Latin\" data-uid=\"374560\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Latin\">Latin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:54:09 +08:00\">20h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>千问办公也来了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944265\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/62d7/c2f2/711346_normal.png?m=1785983067\" alt=\"doujiangjiyaozha\" data-uid=\"711346\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/doujiangjiyaozha\">doujiangjiyaozha</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 12:53:00 +08:00\">19h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Deveik\">Deveik</a> 是的 今年基本都在卷 不过我的优势就是我是业余用 ai 做的 慢慢做 慢慢推广呗 几乎没啥成本 就是当爱好做好了 如果能够后面都能影响到一丢丢大厂的产品 我也知足了 哈哈</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944274\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/62d7/c2f2/711346_normal.png?m=1785983067\" alt=\"doujiangjiyaozha\" data-uid=\"711346\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/doujiangjiyaozha\">doujiangjiyaozha</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 12:57:10 +08:00\">19h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/ebushicao\">ebushicao</a> 功能设计上还是有点区别 大厂现在有配置 api key ，有免费额度 但以后可不好说 现在他们正式烧钱抢占市场的时机 等后面到了分析实际盈利的时候 可能会不一样</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17945358\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/71cccdc034f76a049d380d32385666b4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"YNaN\" data-uid=\"387030\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/YNaN\">YNaN</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 16:04:21 +08:00\">15h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你挑了个 bat 集中竞争的赛道。。。就算你做差异化，他们直接抄你功能集成进去你不就没优势了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"AI 办公 本地21 replies • 2026-08-06 16:04:21 +08:00 1 zhuanggu 21h 20m ago 同为做小工具的人，支持一下。AI 办公这个方向确实竞争激烈，但我觉得细